n></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/t117Yj6w7vtuyelUsvQ5o2v3KAD5uF3jPTEeibe0hOD8PJh1Y2B5JQwn6X9XuL1iaOm0oJ4lOPibCPCR0SiaKFGbzA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><span>四、考核安排（拟定）</span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/t117Yj6w7vs00kiaTyiahOA2WB441RE9Sc5Htzg0YnBo2qnXICyV4vZ7hun5Vax589iczqUre7wROWUAeufib021WQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><span><span>预推免考核暂定以线下方式举行，预计9月中旬。具体安排以最终公布为准，请持续关注相关通知。</span></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/t117Yj6w7vtuyelUsvQ5o2v3KAD5uF3jPTEeibe0hOD8PJh1Y2B5JQwn6X9XuL1iaOm0oJ4lOPibCPCR0SiaKFGbzA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><span>五、申请方式</span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/t117Yj6w7vs7pYtH5vVkC60Cg2c7icGFqcvjpXMgY72drkgubhRibrsKTn09FKjt0zqYW41N8JX2R8ubFWPegvuA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><b><span><font><span><span>1、报名时间：</span></span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span><span>即日起</span></span></font><font><span><span>——8月31日23：59</span></span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span><span>。</span></span></font></span></b><span></span></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>2、登录网址：</span></span></font></span></b><span><font><span><span>南方科技大学研究生招生服务系统（</span></span></font><font><span><span>https://yzbm.sustech.edu.cn/，推荐使用chrome、360浏览器），点击“全国优秀大学生推免生预报名”，选择“深港微电子学院”进行在线报名。申请者需在系统注册登录，并按照要求填写真实信息。</span></span></font></span><b><span><font><span><span>需填报不超过</span></span></font><font><span><span>3位意向报考导师。</span></span></font></span></b><b><span></span></b></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>3、报名需填写上传以下证明材料：</span></span></font></span></b><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><font><span><span>1）身份证正反面复印件或照片；</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><font><span><span>2）学生证复印件或照片；</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><font><span><span>3）包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（院系或教务处加盖公章）；成绩单上标注所在专业的成绩排名；</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><font><span><span>4）个人陈述（介绍学术背景、曾经做过的研究工作，以及将来攻读研究生阶段的学习和研究计划、研究生毕业后的就业目标等，1000字以内）；</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><font><span><span>5）其他体现个人学术水平、综合能力的证明材料（包括但不限于英语水平证书、论文首页及奖状证书等），扫描为一个PDF文件后上传至系统；</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><font><span><span>6）专家推荐信2封</span><span>（</span></span></font></span><b><span><font><span><span>申请博士生需要，硕士生自愿提供，鼓励学生提前联系我院导师进行推荐）；</span></span></font></span></b><b><span></span></b></p><p><span><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><font><span><span>7）个人简历（中文版+英文版）。</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>另请申请者将以上</span></span></font><font><span><span>1-7项材料合并成一个pdf文件发送至：smeyzb@sustech.edu.cn，邮件主题及附件名称为“姓名+2026级推免预报名+学校+专业”。</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>※如申请人填写或提供的材料不真实，一经发现即取消其预录取资格。</span></span></font></span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/t117Yj6w7vtuyelUsvQ5o2v3KAD5uF3jPTEeibe0hOD8PJh1Y2B5JQwn6X9XuL1iaOm0oJ4lOPibCPCR0SiaKFGbzA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><span>六、审核选拔及咨询</span></